This package is a plug-in for LiteLLM (https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm),
which is licensed separately by its authors. LiteLLM is not vendored here:
the hook subclasses `litellm.integrations.custom_logger.CustomLogger` when
LiteLLM is installed, and the scoring and tier logic run without it.

The code in this repository was extracted from a private, single-operator
production hook and rewritten as a standalone library with a fresh history.
No third-party code other than the LiteLLM import above is included.
